       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-PBX-CLAY-SOUND.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PBX-CLAY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-24TRUNK-SEIZE-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DECADIC-PHASE-ROT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ACOUSTIC-COMMUTATION-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EDO22-HARMONICS-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PBX-CLAY-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-PBX-CLAY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PBX-CLAY-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PBX-CLAY-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TRUNKS-AND-DECADIC.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ACOUSTIC-AND-EDO22.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PBX-CLAY-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-TRUNKS-AND-DECADIC.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-24TRUNK-SEIZE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DECADIC-PHASE-ROT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ACOUSTIC-AND-EDO22.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ACOUSTIC-COMMUTATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EDO22-HARMONICS-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PBX-CLAY-PROOFS.
           IF WS-24TRUNK-SEIZE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DECADIC-PHASE-ROT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ACOUSTIC-COMMUTATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-EDO22-HARMONICS-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-PBX-CLAY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PBX-CLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PBX-CLAY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PBX-CLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PBX-CLAY-CODE.
